      "comment": "Do not translate. The TextField placeholder for the fallback category's name, and the literal name of the folder RuleSet.defaults files into. The on-disk name is deliberately not localized — translating it would orphan every file already filed under the old name the moment the system language changed — so the placeholder has to name the folder that actually exists.",
